ations, including Deep One City \n\n• Dynamic Sanity system resulting in hallucinations, panic attacks, vertigo, paranoia, and more! \n\n• Incredibly detailed real-time graphics with atmospheric lighting and dynamic shadows \n\n• Intelligent gameplay involving puzzle solving as well as combat and exploration \n\n• 1920s weaponry and vehicles as well as evil artifacts and alien technology \n\n• Lovecraft's famous monsters and locations","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/header.jpg?t=1573831510"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1573831510"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/0000009021.600x338.jpg?t=1573831510","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/0000009021.1920x1080.jpg?t=1573831510"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/0000009022.600x338.jpg?t=1573831510","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/0000009022.1920x1080.jpg?t=1573831510"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/0000009023.600x338.jpg?t=1573831510","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/0000009023.1920x1080.jpg?t=1573831510"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/0000009024.600x338.jpg?t=1573831510","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/0000009024.1920x1080.jpg?t=1573831510"},{"id":4,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/22340/0000009025.600x3